<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns both secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns both secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed both auctions to purchase paper in the secondary market, whereby it sought to drain 1.502 billion pesos of liquidity .</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS	TERM     MAX    MIN     AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos     14 days  25.80  25.00   25.37    5    5</p>
<p>  502  million pesos  1 day   24.50  24.50   24.50    2    2</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500))</p>
</text>
